<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Maxtel still in Zimbabwe mobile phone talks.</title>
<headline>Maxtel still in Zimbabwe mobile phone talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Maxtel Ltd said on Tuesday an agreement reached in principle in February with Cosmos Cellular (Pvt) Ltd to set up a joint venture cellular payphone network in Zimbabwe was still being finalised.</p>
<p>The company said Cosmos was the leading cellular service provider to the sole GSM cellular network in Zimbabwe, Net One.</p>
<p>Maxtel warned ordinary shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482-1003</p>
</text>
